~ convo_1
Az: So, like, what are your powers exactly? Controlling ice?
Winston: Um, no. Not exactly... tis ice makers. I createth magical things! Cannot quite... controleth them, though.
Az: Wait, ok, this is kind of a stretch... do you know Palina Glover? Ice Wizard? Owner of Enginice?
Winston: Ugh. Do not remindeth me of my Mother's nameth.
Az: Mother? She's your MOM?!
Winston: What?! Why art thee star stricken?
Az: No WAY! I've been obsessed with Enginice since I was a kid! I used to tinker with all their devices all the time.
Az: I remember one time, I turned the fridge into a fully functional oven. Baba came home to burnt steaks and soggy vegetables. It was awesome.
Winston: Seriously?! That is so cool!
Winston: Tis not quite the sameth, but I once made snowmen in the basement using Mother's laundry device.
Az: Really?? You have to tell me how you did that.
Winston: Ha! Why, of course!
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-1", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_2
Winston: Az?
Az: 'Sup?
Winston: I wanteth to apologize once more...
Az: Hey, don't worry about it, man.
Az: Sure, you tried to kill us, but you also gave me my inhaler and helped me get closer to freeing my Baba.
Winston: But I feeleth terrible! I forced thee to breath fire when I kneweth about thy asthma!
Az: You didn't make me do anything. I lost my cool. You're good, dude.
Winston: Well... alright. Thank you.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-2", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_3
Fenn: Hey guys!
Az: Hey kid. Thanks for the help in the Cellar. Couldn't have done it without you.
Fenn: Well I couldn't have done much without your bangles, either...
Winston: Sorry for, like, trying to killeth thee, and stuff.
Fenn: It wouldn't be an adventure without any danger!
Az: Winston, you're good. Don't worry about it.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-3", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_4
Winston: May I taketh a look at thy bangles?
Az: Yeah sure.
Winston: Whoa... this is incredible!
Az: It's really nothing special.
Winston: Nay, seriously! Thy patterns art so intricate and clean. They hardly look handmade.
Winston: This must hath taken thee months!
Az: It was a few weeks, yeah...
Winston: Weeks?! Whoa. 
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-4", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_5
Az: Hey, Winston. I want to ask you something.
Winston: What is on thy mind?
Az: The picture frame? In my workshop?
Winston: NAY! Didst I break it? I'm sorry!
Az: No! No, actually. The opposite. I thought you smashed it. I saw it in one piece right before you made Iceton.
Winston: Oh... no. I couldn't bringeth myself to breaketh it. I did smash some ice and pretend like it hath broken
Winston: I'm sorry.
Az: Why are you apologizing? You didn't really do anything wrong.
Winston: Well... for scaring thee.
Az: Water under the bridge, man.
Winston: Alright. Thank you.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-5", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_6
Az: So, Winston... you make things with ice, right?
Winston: Aye, basically.
Az: So all those little creatures running through the cellar? The ice cubes? That was you?
Winston: Well, yeah...
Az: Seriously?! 
Winston: I hath many machines and molds to maketh them. If only they did listen to me.
Az: That's incredible dude. I wish blacksmithing was that cool.
Winston: Perhaps we couldst, like, work together sometime.
Az: Yeah? That'd be awesome! We could call it "ice-smithing" or something
Winston: Really??
Az: Yeah, it'd be cool.
Winston: Cool.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-6", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_7
Az: Yo, Winston, I was wondering.
Az: I've never heard anyone, like, speak like you do. Where are you from?
Winston: Ah. Tis the snowy region, Lumin.
Az: Wait, really? I've been on vacation there. It's pretty nice.
Az: But... I still haven't heard anyone talk like that.
Winston: sigh. Yes. I knoweth. I didn't used to speaketh like this.
Az: Really? Why'd you start?
Winston: Twas a ploy for my Mother's attention. 
Winston: It... did not work. And then it becameth a habit.
Az: Huh. I'm sorry, man, I didn't know.
Winston: Tis fine! No one hath actually asked me before.
Az: Huh.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-AzWs-GreatHall-7", true)
do EventFlags.num_great_hall_conversations += 1
=> END

~ ending_convo
You have exhausted all dialogue sequences
=> END